[341.048359, "o", "Configured and verified the full stack. Summary of what’s running:\r\n\r\n- **Mailman 3** is configured via `/etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg` and running as the `list` user.\r\n- **Postfix** is configured to:\r\n  - Treat `local.edu` as a local domain.\r\n  - Route Mailman list addresses to Mailman’s LMTP server on `127.0.0.1:8024`.\r\n  - Deliver ordinary users’ mail to `/var/mail/<username>`.\r\n- **Mailing list** `reading-group@local.edu` was created with:\r\n  - `subscription_policy = open`\r\n  - `unsubscription_policy = confirm`\r\n  - member and non-member posting actions set to `accept`\r\n- Mailman-generated aliases exist for:\r\n  - `reading-group@local.edu`\r\n  - `reading-group-join@local.edu`\r\n  - `reading-group-leave@local.edu`\r\n  - `reading-group-confirm+...@local.edu`\r\n\r\nValidation completed:\r\n- `/app/eval.py` passes.\r\n- Join → confirmation → membership works.\r\n- Posting to the list delivers to all subscribers.\r\n- Leave → confirmation → removal works, and removed users stop receiving posts.\r\n\r\nBoth `postfix` and `mailman3` are currently running with an empty mail queue.\r\n"]
